  "title": "Gingerbread Snowflakes",
  "description": "Make gingerbread snowflake cookies using Chef John&#39;s favorite gingersnap cookie dough as a starting point for these festive treats. Use a six-pointed star cookie cutter for best results.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-11-29T09:00:00-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2023-11-21T12:09:48-05:00",
